<summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:var(--svc-title,var(--navy));font-size:25px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em"><span style="flex-shrink:0;order:2;color:var(--svc-accent,var(--gold));font-size:22px;line-height:1.25">+</span>Hearing Aid Services</summary>
<p style="margin:16px 0 14px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Choosing the right hearing aid is about more than selecting the latest technology — it's about expert fitting, precise programming, and personalized care. With more than 25 years of combined experience programming hearing aids, we take the time to understand your hearing, lifestyle, and listening goals before recommending the solution that's right for you. Every hearing aid is carefully verified and fine-tuned to your individual hearing loss, because even the most advanced technology can only perform at its best when it's programmed correctly. From your initial fitting through ongoing adjustments and support, we're committed to helping you achieve the best possible hearing.</p>
